<BaseLayout title="Terms and disclosures | TassieNow" description="Visitor information, independent ranking and advertising disclosures for TassieNow.">
 <section class="content-page">
  <h1>Terms and disclosures</h1>
  <p>TassieNow is an independent, commercially operated visitor and local-discovery website. Listings and event information are provided for general information and can become outdated.</p>
  <h2>Check before travelling</h2>
  <p>Opening hours, event dates, ticket prices, venue locations, access conditions and food-vendor trading arrangements can change. Confirm important details directly with the venue or event organiser. A link does not guarantee an activity is available.</p>
  <h2>Free listings and ranking</h2>
  <p>Ordinary listings remain free. Payment does not determine organic search or discovery ranking, and partners cannot remove competitors from ordinary results.</p>
  <h2>Sponsorship and affiliates</h2>
  <p>Paid placements must be clearly marked as sponsored or advertising. Temporary affiliate links to Pixelwolf partner programmes (PlayAsia, ElevenLabs and Meshy) are labelled as affiliate advertising. TassieNow may earn a commission at no additional cost to visitors. Google AdSense ads may replace affiliate placements when no direct sponsor is booked. Neither sponsorship nor affiliate commission changes organic listing order.</p>
  <h2>Member accounts and community contributions</h2>
  <p>Keep your password and recovery code private. Accounts, saved places and private plans are free. Plan notes are for your own use and do not constitute a booking. Store your recovery code safely: email password resets are not offered.</p>
  <p>Reviews must describe honest first-hand experiences. Do not post harassment, impersonation, spam, private information or unlawful content. Upload only your own photographs with permission from identifiable people. By submitting a photograph you grant TassieNow permission to store, resize and display it with your display name while it remains on the service. You retain ownership and can remove it through your account.</p>
  <p>Reviews and photos are moderated before publication. We may reject or remove inappropriate contributions. Use Report on a published contribution to flag a problem. Current limits are 500 saved places, 50 private plans with 50 stops each, and 30 photos per account; uploads may be paused if storage is full.</p>
  <h2>Third-party sites and corrections</h2>
  <p>External ticketing, booking, mapping and business websites are operated by third parties. Their terms and privacy notices apply when you visit them. Listing corrections are reviewed rather than automatically published, and basic corrections are free.</p>
  <p>Last updated: 16 October 2026.</p>
 </section>
</BaseLayout>